      <DmvStudyPracQuestionID>8</DmvStudyPracQuestionID>
      <DmvStudyPracID>1</DmvStudyPracID>
      <DmvStudyPracQuestionText>A red arrow indicates that you may turn after you come to a complete stop and look both ways for traffic and pedestrians.</DmvStudyPracQuestionText>
      <DmvStudyPracQuestionAnswerText>A red arrow means you must stop if you intend to move in the direction of the arrow. Virginia law prohibits right and left turns at red arrow lights.</DmvStudyPracQuestionAnswerText>
