      <DmvStudyPracID>1</DmvStudyPracID>
      <DmvStudyPracQuestionText>At a red light, come to a complete stop:</DmvStudyPracQuestionText>
      <DmvStudyPracQuestionAnswerText>At a red light, come to a complete stop at the stop line or, if there is no stop line, before entering the intersection or before reaching the crosswalk. Remain stopped as long as the signal is red, unless turns are allowed.</DmvStudyPracQuestionAnswerText>
